I've built the node to its current grant and left out the `http-client` change. Until the graph definition grants `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, the host binds only `inference-llm` for this node. An extra import would fail instantiation, or be rejected by the capability check, because the `with` clause is its entire authority. Once the next release adds the grant, this can be regenerated with the enrichment fetch. That fetch also needs one detail settled: which input field counts as "the input's text" for the `q=` parameter.

